{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1537,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8c393b568acbcb13fe01a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员。改变了我未来的命运之人。\n今天我们要编织怎样的未来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26429bdea6a29abeb9d7cb2deb5cd3618c28fd46617667e5b73b0c6e5a184db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3fca6273424625c34463fd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帽子，遮阳伞，防晒霜！\n阳光会削减体力，\n要好好做好对策哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "542504b05a6302d9798e4a4c42a40a5a8244269b30a98ed0f24bbc3ec2cb24f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b70cb6279c8bfed68f2746",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能共同抵达\n幸福的未来……\n我会依赖您哦，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbf654de0d61c15a65d71bedc186d5ebad91d3c4b994663efb055ee2b4611e8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af1e7cd319f5352bbb8c862e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的训练，\n我都不会妥协。……为了实现\n铭刻在胸中的誓言。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9f5a3b7ada1f4fe57395b26b5135600a42752cb043bd655a012ae48970b123e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:944e14e92ce5a7f4a2e557f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果受挫了也没关系。\n只要怀着纯白的心，重新尝试就好……\n一起重视初心走下去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3b8e4f5892d77686e18222f39af04b45528006f0efa625e23d2725d2658ae76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b3174692ab2589a0f88dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "束带确任，头纱确认。仪容仪表\n要精心打理。……为了让这身礼服姿态，\n能被后辈们憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2830a851b090a7dc0cd614ea36d41367452a50c81a147edb409e0114dcfab75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c7afeec1c0790d521069a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "共同鸣钟吧。\n愿这充满希望的嘹亮钟声，\n能传达到遥远的未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0991bbd47719c070ca0691bbc4064feaf1be67c1de8bfe26158122adaa7c5b43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69604f78d34993774a98aa05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是什么样的道路我都不会停下脚步。\n没有无法实现的思念……只要有您\n在身边，我就能如此坚信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71aa192832837d2a1cefa6ce35ad1b8c94002cb031e8b77f70ed381bbc42dc34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5feb96dcc2a2975ecf0e359",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到构筑起充满幸福的未来为止。\n与您编织故事这件事——\n我在此起誓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6342859f8d6a46786caa9b5d1c26f377fc9851fde265316fcda4526091982c1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:173064c52f5a4c8f398725db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是与您一起，无论在世界的何处，都能战斗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "729f6db1e1cff1b227e0f4ae5039e4a2202fdeb68668db5b60778441c4fb1ac7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40123c7fdd5ad6c901642a93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份思念也将，连绵不断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41da0887819642691a85d12454550b76a464ffb9c2f88543ca5458f302969885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:673d3d8a4feb6723ec13fe4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我与您的故事，\n今后也会……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0a87bc4511688888c08cdd1f6419e03c811b69974cfd8a0c012723916fcdec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77fac0e68ed6406fbf8e3e08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这束花，\n能传达到未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47796ab71799c410f961cc2e33563d47830404592689dcd5deb77ef398d53233",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0637618026296e2b450da69e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如橡树一般坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aeb2f84019919e180718cc09fb3d8c0a0decf66995556cc7d8956365afd2fcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b8ddc56c2c6ea4e75be306b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，改写命运吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2785a77ab83f27790065aae263d6249aebd5c7b0ed4f2cbd0745d714fc5f5f2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b8d076805d7cc7e9549cbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是西沙里奥。\n请多关照，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e8c9b0a6740499354a9a8a1572d0915ec353453075368199a48aee7b8e681ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3df281098c4e6e990bc45cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿与我共同，成为基石吗。\n为了那未曾谋面的——未来的基石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c495190dc5e09bc3b6b4849547a06365e0e7012a98a3a5f6e818972cfd00f087",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a273a37c8f9f327644b13bc7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "改良指导方法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3282abf1f001d2067e5b3155df7df0c37f5d419665b270735496da43f0cff9a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38a711e0f5a573958fefce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请助我一臂之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e79ff6e4b72308c2fe12594d8204564069d86bc4a7cf8215e4c687cb662fe05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9d07ff9289aa39288e6265",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "献上更多的祝福！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d9cf4e9ffed1a5b476a94e892561625048e10e6bed87a9809a45070a1aebb96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77261bedb39aac149d26a91e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条路没有尽头！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4a109c2d95181b2fb78efaf8b9c142d949097e23b1a32cf24294d9e2be72fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d00345ba89656f7f1f28136",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条连绵不断的大河——\n您愿意与我一同前行吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbed0894272946ae44f9548be96aa2a6fc0b6fa5f75b5e6380b14205ba98e30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c58c631003b8468e88667b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是西沙里奥。让我们共赴未来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8ba0c15ba32cbef91c73a82b79fdcc7f715217c9c65a9915a11b4ed8342444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24de25543465744546fac856",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，出发吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10d75e3fc5936a1264a118742ee8879f0bd608d88f86db003bc2a3fff32ca93b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0145b7d0b898423ff7cd1774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还请您助我一臂之力。\r\n为了证明由母亲传下、由我继承的东西――\r\n有多么伟大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7501e0d29d442417dd3334090cb0c999f2f08de44540a9387f88cdefd21b04cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c32f401d15f2ec91d1104a90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc4d55eaa4dc484db956d855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5204aa8f0aea0d2a618fedb2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕是不起眼的工作也默默努力…。\r\n能遇见拥有相同价值观的您，\r\n我感到非常幸福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70c43f232e262017b467af3d0fe62aa00e0a1edfd7fb3b4cdc0e60748bfa314f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab3e40c6a32580b319e27bc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近，休息日都是怎么度过的？\r\n那个……如果我们有共同的爱好，\r\n我想和您一起尝试。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6f210b8ea08f179c5a1639fb737abc3312b9bfb2e5c2f87b9396f63ed30783",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:026d12d6ecc8c7c392696cd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年试笔的词定好了吗？我的是\n『积水成渊』。为了不忘这份心境，\n打算把它挂在宿舍房间里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8658e742a6965dda50d49ebf3696d37e50846fa7f596bd9ba1fe911e1adb2d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f1a87d6e37049c5f688d91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我试着追求了一点意外性。\r\n炸薯条淋巧克力酱\r\n据说意外地好吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dabb4fa0aab9c856fb13479363e1fc20267c40da5707b274a72ab2c0e2b0db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd2fec7c85d6cec3699a4bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是照着食谱，认真地做了\r\n不过……也正因如此，我相信这份味道，\r\n一定会合您的口味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6db01edea456cfbe66d8955d1246f851b74720d9ad2f00abaaca7db56cfcf13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d2361ddff5192126c3d937f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "写在短册上的不是愿望，而是\r\n信念。梦想是一步步积累，\r\n再用自己的手去抓住的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b50972d32fdcb91829c0bd8df28d438d127a95f1e78ac5637d683fa1f076aa9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc70e8131cfd3cc73385c913",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节，也是学习的机会。\r\n我想从大家的恶作剧中，获得如何\r\n打破自身外壳的启发",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d01e1b6c9f527b7f10d0644572a9503014bc5429f800d2dff8dad9ebbc2a246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029dd000e4a7356795754123",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我会在枕边放点心\r\n那个……是幼小的心里觉得『圣诞老人\r\n好像很辛苦』才那样做的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ea0a4f53c22e509fca9f3b817fa2f39a87aa86be0610ee4b8b63112b5bf13f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c6d06302a3040b4207cc973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节款的苔藓生态瓶……也许\r\n不算华丽，\r\n可以的话……要不要一起看？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a03e97aacb5f37df59b2356d1c9cc12d6e936ea3ac9a03c90745236553f72c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b4b93e0cd10368ea8f613fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是努力得来的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f32084b81c66edf853a5635945976ebcf7dddd99f7a2bf97aa6c66a82e84dde0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:224b8560d52a44a78f6872d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也为了迎接新年，\r\n一点一点打扫吧。\r\n分工照旧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e0f459071336f724cfd81b754185aeb3c01fe45a465d6f7ea0f00e1d32db3ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:278b02b623a3de14e1d09dc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐，恭喜您。\r\n愿您的踏实与真诚，今年也能\r\n得到回报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66c891cdf0b30d3735a4dcb6a2c372cf3e24e1b81904450d12c0f621954889e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19402f3e7e843dbccd6a8416",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了今天，我一直在逐步\r\n做准备。也准备了各种放松用品\r\n来招待您",
      "source_fingerprint": "43bfae3db0564b224ed9b011fe53b7df892f55c5d1b4a67d66de2edf4f18ae81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4a28a2408d6c88348a0ccd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日我也准备和平时一样度过\r\n即使年岁渐长，认真面对眼前之事的\r\n态度也不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "526968c3b628763e6ea1e2d2c0110391fd8de7bc90162e3d376d04ffabe40169",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95131760f121bc56c27f030e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您为我庆祝生日……谢谢\r\n您。为了回报您的关怀，\r\n我会继续精进",
      "source_fingerprint": "072675da2024418822be11bac4b8143d182e677bf10f10147a9a2ac01f7adbed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:259b3369bd69ab939b3c229d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有联络事项送到了呢。\r\n您现在要确认吗？\r\n若是需要复查就交给我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "710d15e9f36ef6414b7cb22612970c1e89cda0c5fb1a901f967238d716ff5cbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f6ce4bef3d5c5403b74eaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了，\r\n您已经确认过了吗？\r\n还没看过的话我们一起确认吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a3849f5bc9f7aad1206c97f059b7fe3b321e00a80d17982f295d3f6d8945475",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45656af71c34fcbbd57ca510",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成目标，恭喜您。\r\n您的踏实努力开花结果了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d218788a701f59fb50f3fafa2e844e91423772c43aa69514cba43c19ab760733",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e53cc7dce68608df05b0cd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下一次活动，也从现在起一起\r\n研究对策吧。\r\n周全的规划就是胜利的关键，对吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a778b5bbeefbc0643b6f7b28706a54c2998e7a525ea0bd78f2430fed0063ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24e2f62d4f88bb50bbd4325a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在进行。那个……\r\n不妨借这个机会，试试吧。\r\n为了突破自我，去挑战…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78fe575978928a0b507fdf665cefc8b22c5f5c69d371221a3e9da453334c97b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:292869edf8189b57448c2d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得反省…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3368547bb930fa66a0660b2fe52a9e58c5c8c484060e437dd12c5a5f1240c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:964b73846322423e4dbe51e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级好像提升了。\r\n不愧是您呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f2b0ab8365155e2cc5f590ac80334c43896ec39dbcb4be5b5d549c7e87384aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93109850fac6ed56cfdc6245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件开衫，和母亲的是\r\n不同颜色。穿着它，一起\r\n出门的日子……脚步都会轻快起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e88512d722286982699994722ba462c934da979bca3b7aee106cd27bc79c00a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e56df58fce30df243accebb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平时不会经过的路上有家陌生的店\r\n……我在那里探险时遇见的，\r\n就是这条项链。",
      "source_fingerprint": "014c5d2eea5d7aa9fd3765c1f54ac0f6a417d080ef06457d3ae3a87f1b0a98cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c51081d6fae389664fc8cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息日我也会看漫画。\r\n一边培养友情一边不懈努力，\r\n最后取得胜利……王道剧情，很热血吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef0ca4ab6edae2cc020e9b7756d360d49042c56aefad1da8171235234607e9fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63525bffa19ccc961bad27e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很难对付呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2e3451a2c80791b5aeb3cd244219561581b0e2fe3d1367bf1294098ae7bca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc5d2cfa185bfc2a23a1951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场胜利，献给母亲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f053c48340d1c91e87a6602551b69f8b063dfe1a075c0a51122f91140ec0ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96875a91781404451692dac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得反省…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3368547bb930fa66a0660b2fe52a9e58c5c8c484060e437dd12c5a5f1240c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c5e6473c9336ac2636dbf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很难对付呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2e3451a2c80791b5aeb3cd244219561581b0e2fe3d1367bf1294098ae7bca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:189863e585ebf047b6599b9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "纪录，刷新了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2eddebd5f4ac6d2eeaa5ac04f231a6a7f8bd36fdb719435a9a089ed11561653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e95e11b3cb9ac2ff1b0e8b6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起赢下来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd29f7815fed211ed0e1c5c798a905cb8289d493609b5d6015ab2ec000187dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0cd9b1bcf05e0d787234245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:861ca38b78919092f90edc56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起锻炼吧。\r\n着眼于努力之后的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c2d08066a17fe513227ca0b618ca1054bd3221b2916fd1f2ed4f38c353039d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32156100b16c5eb039ef14b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谦逊地学习，应该能从历史中\r\n有所收获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c24e28f4c6ed058b5e3c403d434959058935ffb03428ccb0514d63795002dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:928c70e1e7baafa5e9f9041d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要报名呢。\r\n我认为这是展示平日成果的良机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd70381bd1a4a4787335a4e51ad622f9d601ff642757b08b0f3ee00b765ef0f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b590b91790ce8f7cfbf87fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘，Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb83cf4ef414ba1498ca22eb71c89743df595040a09f9d503fb2e9db9beca0d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f613928929cb04046aa1cfcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这份力量，\r\n踏实地积累下去…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f8b8d8c56f6f500fd75793b666b03984d439c8e37a5e492cbd983ee861d7e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1c53c881ad180947bad263",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将平日的成果――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec5367484da8159ad0091fc056b663f358d2750a08e77b76760b8e4f09d655a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c78a601d3a88e5b6a7c3b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备得如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc64529a5be733a07859b691f639d888eb8c4370857ccdfd236044ad095aad3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "1218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0d1596cb27ff0f1a5f9a51a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc7b99b32d8f34da6bd620973df2ae9a0a57751a69db6f6dffcae6088fc7c17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bc767c196146474d8ac0c12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a0073db61d307b0cf143cacaab07a3f9fac86881bea0840ad304fe021c9f35b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c63d98776ca80610071888be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做得漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcca281f53948ed2959e6c02db69e3cc0bea2f2f81b8ab69eede9f94f6f1d789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:375a94a34a13ca406d1b5389",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ad0243b825a35943ac53be5793f305c0e6880cc447bde1e8dd30c9f769995a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a815aa7d8d0cb7b99bb5268f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是高手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "413c3061b54cf1d5d9719e66be9db6a6e768255da7fcb6f82cfa9ada1b61bf5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f52c458ece8af8f1726d2998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身手真漂亮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f86d6f722fa92a60e60c19367e27cd141120332890e05acd25067c7dfd00b79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1111",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32754d132a5cfea783259d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次很可惜呢…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c7100f618d4147f1f483aa23b1aa1adb8b6991b3f9ca2589bf684bcd7048644",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
